{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 43, :comments ["<b>This is the statute of the Pesach.</b> For all generations, regarding those who may eat it and the place. For indeed the commandments stated above, apart from these two, did not apply for all generations, as the Sages of blessed memory said (Pesachim 96a): the Pesach of generations does not require dabbing blood on the lintel and the two doorposts, and is not eaten in haste."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:17.523524765Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}